10 REM Reset script to run the boot rom at Reset
20 REM Clear reset vector catch (may be already cleared by connect script)
30 b% = peek32 this 0x00203000
40 a% = peek32 this 0x00203004
50 cmbreakset this a%
60 cmresetvectorcatchclear this
70 REM Select reset type
80 cmsysresetreq this
90 REM cmvectresetreq this
100 cmbreakclear this a%
110 end
